WEBVTT

00:09:59.637 --> 00:10:03.307
our kids will learn confidence,
financial literacy,

00:10:03.349 --> 00:10:06.352
public speaking, how to convince people,

00:10:06.393 --> 00:10:10.064
all skills that are valuable
for the world that we live in.

00:10:10.105 --> 00:10:11.899
So don't give them an allowance.

00:10:13.067 --> 00:10:17.780
The next thing is
make them pay for their wants.

00:10:18.781 --> 00:10:20.449
You know, key to entrepreneurship

00:10:20.449 --> 00:10:24.703
is about personal
responsibility and ownership.

00:10:25.996 --> 00:10:27.998
And it is amazing how,

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:30.459
when you put the responsibility
on someone else